  "description": "SimpLog.Databases.MySQL is a lightweight .NET logging library that allows applications to log messages directly into MySQL Database. It supports multiple log levels (Trace, Debug, Info, Notice, Warn, Error, Fatal) and automatically manages database tables if they don’t exist. Fully configurable and easy to integrate in .NET applications.",
